55
00:01:51.930 --> 00:01:53.870
someone that maybe you even forgotten about,

56
00:01:53.870 --> 00:01:55.300
someone probably from your past

57
00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:57.390
who did something really small,

58
00:01:57.390 --> 00:01:59.030
